Status - Overview ACL: allow reading the online CPU list (for the load meters)

The Apex System widgets (patch 0002) scale each load-average meter by the number
of CPUs, which the status ACL could not read. Grant exactly one more read-only
file, /sys/devices/system/cpu/online (a short range list such as "0-3"), to the
existing luci-mod-status-index group - no new group, no write access, no wider
path.

Applies to: https://git.openwrt.org/project/luci.git
            @ 350fc919675bb62e415927afff65697fcb8f775d (pinned in feeds.conf.default)
Applied by: tools/cw-apply-feed-patches.sh (patch -p1, zero fuzz).
Upstream status: not submitted (CleanWRT-specific).

